/T (I declare that all work in thisreport wascarried out only against lab-owned, authorized targets. Every domain used ends in .example, a name reserved by RFC 2606 that can never be registered on the public Internet, and every DNS zone is served by a BIND 9 name server that I started myself on the loopback interface of my own lab machine. No packet was sent to any third-party system, no social-engineering attack was launched against any real person, and every organization, employee and e-mail address in Q3 is fictional. )
