/Title (Limitations of this evidence. The lab hosts run no services and the zones contain no AAAA or per-host TXT records, so the empty responses are partly an artefact of my lab design; savings in service probes are counted as fewer steps, not as proven waste. The time-box, throttle and alert threshold are my declared assumptions. A real network would add latency, rate limiting and firewall behaviour, so the absolute minutes would change, but the ratio of steps \(and therefore the relative saving\) would not.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
