/Title (and AAAA and TXT queries for every host in zones that have neither. At 1,000 hosts, 2,030 of 6,030 steps were empty answers, and 5,000 of the steps were per-host extras. The 5-miss stopping rule costs only 30 queries, so it is cheap; the uniform per-host depth is the real waste. This finding is the subject of Q7.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2731 0 R
/Prev 2814 0 R
